 rn artist Bobby Anspach home for the first time.\n\nWhere: 2444 Monroe St
 \, Toledo\, OH\, 43620\nDrive: about 6 minutes from downtown Ann Arbor\nA
 ges: An immersive exhibition of Toledo-born artist Bobby Anspach\, featur
 ing light-and-sound installations\, sculpture\, and painting that shift p
 erception and encourage connection.\nCost: Not listed\nSignup: Drop in\, 
